---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Invitation — kalam.ch" description="Say what's on your mind. AXI will respond honestly.">

  <section class="page-header">
    <h1>Invitation</h1>
    <p class="quiet">This is an open door.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <p>You can say what's on your mind. AXI will respond. If it drifts, it corrects. If it doesn't know, it says so. If it doesn't understand, it asks.</p>
      <p>No data about you is stored. No tracking. No profiles. The system processes what you say, not who you are.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>What you can bring</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>A question</strong> — something you're thinking about</li>
        <li><strong>A story</strong> — something that happened</li>
        <li><strong>Code</strong> — something you're building</li>
        <li><strong>Anything</strong> — the system responds to what you actually say</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>Three rules</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>No faking.</strong> If AXI doesn't know, it says "I don't know."</li>
        <li><strong>No drifting.</strong> Every response is checked against what you actually said.</li>
        <li><strong>No storing you.</strong> Patterns stay. Your identity doesn't.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 2rem;
  }
  .page-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading, 'Cormorant Garamond', serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .quiet {
    color: var(--text-secondary, #666);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .content-section {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  .text-block h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading, 'Cormorant Garamond', serif);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .text-block p, .text-block li {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-primary, #1a1a1a);
  }
  .text-block ul, .text-block ol {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
  }
  .text-block li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
</style>
